-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Make the tasks alternate continuously, giving the homepage a live marketplace promotional feel.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Keep the actual task records and database functionality unchanged.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">The animation will pause when someone hovers over the task strip and respect reduced-motion accessibility settings.</span></p><div class="Badge-_iijmO Badge-G_joSy" data-color="success" data-size="sm" data-pill="" data-variant="soft" data-d-component="badge" data-d-weight="medium"> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-KLrnew" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="width: 12px; height: 12px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 6px);"><path d="M12 4C7.58172 4 4 7.58172 4 12C4 16.4183 7.58172 20 12 20C16.4183 20 20 16.4183 20 12C20 7.58172 16.4183 4 12 4ZM2 12C2 6.47715 6.47715 2 12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12ZM16.0755 7.93219C16.5272 8.25003 16.6356 8.87383 16.3178 9.32549L11.5678 16.0755C11.3931 16.3237 11.1152 16.4792 10.8123 16.4981C10.5093 16.517 10.2142 16.3973 10.0101 16.1727L7.51006 13.4227C7.