<section class="conversation-intro" id="conversations"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUILT-IN CUSTOMER &amp; PROVIDER MESSAGING</div><h2>Conversations that move work forward</h2><p>Ask general questions in the public task thread. When the customer selects a provider, a private conversation opens for detailed arrangements.</p></div><div class="conversation-rules"><div><b>01 Â· Public task discussion</b><span>Visible to signed-in marketplace members. Contact details and personal links are blocked.</span></div><div><b>02 Â· Private negotiation</b><span>Available to the customer and selected provider only, after an offer is accepted.</span></div></div></section>
