<section class="trust" id="safety"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRUST IS THE FOUNDATION</div><h2>Your work. Your data.<br><em>Your control.</em></h2><p>Public contact filtering is applied in the browser and reinforced by a database trigger after you install the supplied SQL update. No automated filter catches every possible attempt, so users can also report suspicious content.</p><a href="https://codex-inline-visualization-8f0017638b8f55b4.web-sandbox.oaiusercontent.com/?app=skybridge&amp;locale=en-US&amp;deviceType=desktop&amp;unsafeSkipTargetOriginCheck=true&amp;backgroundMode=transparent#terms" class="underlink">Read platform rules â†’</a></div><div class="trust-cards"><article><b>â—‰ Public by design</b><p>Phone numbers, emails, social handles, personal links, payment details and exact addresses are not allowed in public messages.</p></article><article><b>â–£ Private when selected</b><p>Private chat is restricted to the task owner and the provider whose offer was accepted.</p></article><article><b>â™¢ Company support</b><p>For platform support, contact <a href="mailto:networke@gmail.com">networke@gmail.com</a>.</p></article></div></section>
